# EAS Build's cloud archiver falls back to .gitignore rules when this file is
# absent. The root .gitignore excludes google-services.json / GoogleService-Info.plist
# from git (they're not committed - contain Firebase API keys), but EAS Build still
# needs them present in the uploaded project archive to wire them into the generated
# native project. This file overrides that fallback: everything listed below is
# excluded from the upload, and the Firebase config files are deliberately NOT listed,
# so they get included even though git never sees them.

node_modules/
.expo/
android/local.properties
*.log
